refused: d109_same_base_doesnt_mix.cy:12:40, line 12 column 40
12 |     let $b: i32[unit: money.dollars] = $a + 1 money.cents;
   |                                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 what: this mixes `i32[unit: money.dollars]` and `i32[unit: money.cents]`
 why:  the same units can add and compare, and mixing them is refused (D100)
